      "writtenOn": "2023-08-16T07:37:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello, we are using this symbol to know wakeup reason of specific IC(like wifi/modem) which using IRQF_NO_SUSPEND flag as it\u0027s irq.\nBecause the irq which using IRQF_NO_SUSPEND not calling log_irq_wakeup_reason() so we used log_suspend_abort_reason as workaround.",
      "parentUuid": "5d2b6c3f_ae09bbdb",
      "revId": "74a47b95e8799623a3bed78cc400be452d173add",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
